{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>有看哈利波特電影的大家，對故事的怪獸書一定不陌生！價格上課的時候會用到，這本書具有攻擊性，想打開的話就要摸摸書脊才能打開，不然他就會咬人！</p><p>最近發現了這個怪獸書造型的攬枕，也可當作枕頭用。打開裡面是充滿哈利波特元素的圖案，有分類帽、眼鏡、貓頭鷹等等。最有趣的是，當你當作枕頭的時候，它會自動合作，咬你的頭！！</p><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/178421769909257650_13911085576a5900667a41c.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/178421770656997658_5625485956a59006df35d6.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/178421771424737815_1627590636a5900755f755.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/178421772096051512_9857449206a59007a63183.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文 新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-16T16:18:58.023981+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":221,"images":4,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none"}}